WEBVTT

00:17.890 --> 00:19.060
<b>Are we ready to get started?</b>

00:19.430 --> 00:20.640
<b>We’re ready, sir.</b>

00:27.770 --> 00:28.690
<b>What’s ready?</b>

00:43.540 --> 00:44.830
<b>WAKE UP.</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:46.880
<b>GOT SOMETHING FOR YOU.</b>

00:50.300 --> 00:52.800
<b>YOU’RE FAST. WHERE DO WE MEET YOU?</b>

00:52.880 --> 00:57.180
<b>X MARKS THE SPOT.</b>

01:01.100 --> 01:01.930
<b>All right.</b>

01:02.600 --> 01:04.730
<b>We’ve got passports.
Told you he’d come through.</b>

01:14.940 --> 01:16.320
<b>These guys are relentless.</b>

01:16.950 --> 01:19.280
<b><i>Update on the Hulong Lab kidnapping.</i></b>

01:19.530 --> 01:22.290
<b><i>The suspect, Makoto Midorikawa,</i>
<i>is traveling with a companion.</i></b>

01:22.370 --> 01:24.700
<b><i>Caucasian male, early forties, tall.</i></b>

01:24.790 --> 01:27.620
<b>If they close the airport, we’re screwed.
We gotta move.</b>

01:54.070 --> 01:58.700
<b><i>Are you ready for what lies ahead, Agent?</i></b>

03:32.540 --> 03:34.250
<b>Pretty sure this is the right spot.</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:40.300
<b>Hey! Over here.</b>

03:41.170 --> 03:42.010
<b>Zion!</b>

03:42.090 --> 03:42.930
<b>That guy?</b>

03:43.130 --> 03:43.970
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:44.930 --> 03:46.140
<b>A blast from my past.</b>

03:51.430 --> 03:53.520
<b>Sorry to drag you out of your basement.</b>

03:54.150 --> 03:56.770
<b>Don’t be.
Had some action out here anyways.</b>

03:57.150 --> 04:01.240
<b>Let’s go somewhere private.
You and I have a lot to talk about.</b>

04:08.030 --> 04:11.120
<b>Your face is over the web.
You kidnap someone?</b>

04:11.200 --> 04:13.210
<b>Of course not! Just gimme our--</b>

04:13.290 --> 04:14.120
<b>Say no more!</b>

04:15.290 --> 04:18.630
<b>Your care package.
Tickets and some props.</b>

04:19.130 --> 04:19.960
<b>Props?</b>

04:20.460 --> 04:22.630
<b>You never know! They’re on the house.</b>

04:23.800 --> 04:28.470
<b>I’ve already done the beauty pass
on your docs. Be sure to dress the part.</b>

04:29.760 --> 04:30.930
<b>These are pretty damn good.</b>

04:31.520 --> 04:32.930
<b>Anything for an old friend.</b>

04:33.310 --> 04:35.230
<b>Just remember that when it’s time to pay.</b>

04:40.570 --> 04:42.320
<b>Zion, is that...</b>

04:42.400 --> 04:43.240
<b>Oh, this?</b>

04:44.030 --> 04:45.200
<b>It’s called Ingress.</b>

04:45.780 --> 04:46.820
<b>You know about that?</b>

04:47.570 --> 04:48.910
<b>It’s all the rage!</b>

04:49.280 --> 04:54.960
<b>I’m an Enlightened Agent in
a global battle for the fate of humanity.</b>

04:57.670 --> 05:00.340
<b>Somebody compromised the Ingress scanner.</b>

05:00.420 --> 05:04.470
<b>And now people everywhere are using it
to fight for control of the Portals.</b>

05:05.720 --> 05:07.890
<b>Sarah told me something about that, too.</b>

05:08.510 --> 05:11.850
<b>They managed to disguise it
as a game to cover it up.</b>

05:13.270 --> 05:15.230
<b>It seems your pal here
is a devoted player.</b>

05:16.520 --> 05:18.900
<b>You an Agent as well? What Faction?</b>

05:21.110 --> 05:24.190
<b>He's with the Resistance.
I’m Enlightened, though.</b>

05:25.030 --> 05:28.110
<b>That’s a good choice, my friend.
All the best are Enlightened.</b>

05:28.200 --> 05:30.870
<b>Let’s help turn the world green, shall we?</b>

05:38.620 --> 05:39.750
<b>Crap, they took it!</b>

05:40.420 --> 05:42.210
<b>The Resistance move so fast!</b>

05:46.670 --> 05:47.760
<b>What are you doing?</b>

05:47.840 --> 05:49.260
<b>My mission!</b>

05:49.340 --> 05:53.640
<b>We’re creating a Supernova
at the tower near the zoo.</b>

05:54.720 --> 05:55.980
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

05:56.890 --> 06:00.520
<b>You don’t know?
Prepare to have your mind blown wide open.</b>

06:01.020 --> 06:05.110
<b>When you create many Links to one Portal,
that Portal becomes incredibly powerful.</b>

06:05.780 --> 06:09.200
<b>And it looks exactly like a "Supernova!"</b>

06:09.490 --> 06:13.660
<b>Damn, I gotta get to the next Portal.
My operator needs me in 10 minutes!</b>

06:13.740 --> 06:15.870
<b>Yeah, Zion, we should get out of here too.</b>

06:16.410 --> 06:17.580
<b>-Let's see...
-Hold it.</b>

06:18.750 --> 06:20.210
<b>We’ve wasted too much time here.</b>

06:21.830 --> 06:22.750
<b>We’re surrounded.</b>

06:24.630 --> 06:25.920
<b>If we get out, we’re made.</b>

06:26.010 --> 06:28.130
<b>Can you use your ability
to see how they’ll react?</b>

06:29.090 --> 06:33.300
<b>No... too many Enlightened Links.
I can't create a Field.</b>

06:36.520 --> 06:39.020
<b>One more favor.
Take us to the airport, now!</b>

06:39.980 --> 06:40.980
<b>No way, I’m linking!</b>

06:41.600 --> 06:42.440
<b>Now!</b>

06:45.530 --> 06:47.110
<b>You drive a hard bargain.</b>

06:47.570 --> 06:50.030
<b>I still have a mission, though.
You’re going to have to help.</b>

06:55.450 --> 06:57.660
<b>This bike matches the VIN number.</b>

06:57.750 --> 06:58.830
<b>Then he’s nearby.</b>

07:05.500 --> 07:08.970
<b><i>A motorcycle used by</i>
<i>the kidnapping suspects</i></b>

07:09.050 --> 07:11.430
<b><i>has been spotted</i>
<i>at the Nishi-Shinsaibashi Chuo-ku.</i></b>

07:11.510 --> 07:15.100
<b><i>Narrowing the search to the local area.</i>
<i>Requesting additional backup.</i></b>

07:20.060 --> 07:21.770
<b>Hey! Be careful!
You're gonna burn yourself.</b>

07:22.270 --> 07:23.100
<b>Hot!</b>

07:26.150 --> 07:26.980
<b>But tasty.</b>

07:29.780 --> 07:32.610
<b>Fleeing the country, exposing evil plans.</b>

07:32.700 --> 07:34.160
<b>You’re living in a fairy tale, buddy.</b>

07:35.490 --> 07:37.200
<b>You think we’ll make it
through the airport?</b>

07:37.700 --> 07:40.790
<b>Gotta move fast. Careful with immigration.</b>

07:41.660 --> 07:43.710
<b>Make sure you use an auto gate.</b>

07:51.800 --> 07:53.510
<b>Thanks a lot. I owe you one.</b>

07:53.590 --> 07:54.720
<b>I’ll send a bill.</b>

08:01.060 --> 08:04.100
<b>Hey, when you land in Switzerland,
cap some Portals!</b>

08:06.980 --> 08:09.150
<b>So XM is real and this is not a game...</b>

08:11.360 --> 08:14.200
<b>Alright then, maybe the world
is not what it seems.</b>

08:25.580 --> 08:27.080
<b>We’ve just arrived at the airport.</b>

08:28.090 --> 08:31.090
<b><i>Get rid of them as soon as you find them.</i>
<i>Be discreet.</i></b>

08:31.460 --> 08:32.300
<b>Sir.</b>

08:51.400 --> 08:52.780
<b>I really hope this works.</b>

08:55.860 --> 08:57.030
<b>Next in line, please.</b>

08:59.410 --> 09:01.330
<b>Keep moving.
There are multiple terminals.</b>

09:04.460 --> 09:05.670
<b>We made it through.</b>

09:06.460 --> 09:08.670
<b>Your guy’s good.
Maybe you are useful for something.</b>

09:09.420 --> 09:11.340
<b>He wants us to be discreet in an airport?</b>

09:11.670 --> 09:12.550
<b>Shut up!</b>

09:20.390 --> 09:23.390
<b>If we screw up again,
we might be next on Hulong’s hitlist.</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:26.100
<b>So stop your bitching.</b>

09:26.190 --> 09:27.100
<b>Guys, there!</b>

09:30.310 --> 09:32.110
<b>It’s them. Come on!</b>

09:50.920 --> 09:51.750
<b>We’re here.</b>

09:54.920 --> 09:59.720
<b>We prepared this area just for you.
I think you’ll find it familiar.</b>

10:00.930 --> 10:02.810
<b>What the hell are you going to do to me?</b>

10:03.390 --> 10:05.020
<b>There’s no need to panic.</b>

10:05.770 --> 10:09.900
<b>We’ll be studying your unique abilities.
Just like while you were at Hulong.</b>

10:10.980 --> 10:13.480
<b>We need those abilities
for a very important project.</b>

10:14.690 --> 10:18.990
<b>So until that project is done,
I will need your full cooperation.</b>

10:23.780 --> 10:25.040
<b>Make sure you don’t hurt her.</b>

10:33.920 --> 10:36.590
<b>This is nice. I like flying first class!</b>

10:37.210 --> 10:39.180
<b>Didn’t realize your buddy’s
such a high roller.</b>

10:39.510 --> 10:42.010
<b>He’s just a hacker who knows how
to work the system.</b>

10:42.930 --> 10:45.970
<b>Now that we’re heading to Switzerland,
how do we find Sarah?</b>

10:47.100 --> 10:48.640
<b>I’ll have to figure it out.</b>

10:49.190 --> 10:51.650
<b>Got any leads?
Like where their headquarters are?</b>

10:51.850 --> 10:53.520
<b>Hulong’s HQ is in China.</b>

10:54.230 --> 10:56.570
<b>Don’t know of any standing facilities
in Switzerland.</b>

10:57.820 --> 11:00.660
<b>In any case,
we’ll deal with it once we get there.</b>

11:05.330 --> 11:06.160
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:15.500 --> 11:17.510
<b>Progress is at 89%.</b>

11:18.090 --> 11:20.420
<b>Glyphs encoded in the signal.
Starting our analysis.</b>

11:21.550 --> 11:24.890
<b>Look at that! The signal’s so strong.</b>

11:25.930 --> 11:28.430
<b>It’s funny how she’s unaware
of her true power.</b>

11:29.640 --> 11:33.230
<b>Visualizing XM is just a scratch
on the surface...</b>

11:36.570 --> 11:39.240
<b>TARGETS ON PLANE BOUND FOR SWITZERLAND.
WE'RE ALSO ABOARD. HOWEVER...</b>

11:43.280 --> 11:46.330
<b><i>We’re now at cruising altitude over India</i>
<i>and expect an on-time arrival.</i></b>

11:47.450 --> 11:50.620
<b>DON’T BOTHER ME WITH DETAILS.
TAKE CARE OF THEM. NOW.</b>

11:52.500 --> 11:53.330
<b>Now what?</b>

11:53.420 --> 11:59.760
<b><i>The local time is 4:30 p.m.</i>
<i>The weather is clear and sunny.</i></b>

11:59.840 --> 12:00.880
<b>Are you crazy?</b>

12:00.970 --> 12:02.970
<b>They can’t use XM up here.</b>

12:07.390 --> 12:09.470
<b>I’m sorry, sir. First class pass--</b>

12:17.310 --> 12:18.150
<b>Did you hear that?</b>

12:18.650 --> 12:21.190
<b>-No, I didn’t hear anything.
-I’ll take a look.</b>

12:21.740 --> 12:22.610
<b>You think it’s Hulong?</b>

12:22.700 --> 12:23.530
<b>Keep your head down.</b>

12:32.750 --> 12:33.580
<b>What?!</b>

12:48.390 --> 12:49.220
<b>What’s going on?</b>

12:51.640 --> 12:52.770
<b>This can’t be happening!</b>

12:56.560 --> 12:58.230
<b>THIS IS AN OPPORTUNITY. USE IT.</b>

13:15.580 --> 13:19.380
<b>YOUR FAMILY WILL LEARN
OF HULONG’S GENEROSITY. UNDERSTOOD?</b>

13:31.760 --> 13:33.180
<b>They're crazy to attack us here!</b>

13:35.350 --> 13:36.190
<b>Where'd he go?</b>

13:45.360 --> 13:46.530
<b>They’re all dead!</b>

13:47.200 --> 13:48.030
<b>Damn!</b>

13:49.320 --> 13:52.330
<b>I’ll see you bastards...
on the other side.</b>

13:55.160 --> 13:56.330
<b>That son of a bitch.</b>

13:56.830 --> 13:58.040
<b>Oh shit! Now what?</b>

13:59.290 --> 14:00.170
<b>We’re going down.</b>

14:12.100 --> 14:14.810
<b>What's happening? They need to make...</b>

14:16.310 --> 14:18.770
<b>-Can you fly?
-I missed that class.</b>

14:23.150 --> 14:25.610
<b>We’re losing altitude.
Things aren’t looking good.</b>

14:37.540 --> 14:39.710
<b>-Dammit.
-Wait.</b>

14:56.060 --> 14:57.930
<b>Move. It’s my turn.</b>

14:58.600 --> 14:59.440
<b>Your what?</b>

15:00.310 --> 15:01.150
<b>I got this.</b>

15:03.440 --> 15:05.940
<b>For real? You sure?</b>

15:06.030 --> 15:06.860
<b>Quiet.</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:19.710
<b>Clever. Tapping into the memory
of the instruments!</b>

15:19.790 --> 15:21.290
<b>He opened the fuel reserve!</b>

15:22.080 --> 15:23.080
<b>We can't fly this thing!</b>

15:34.220 --> 15:35.470
<b>-Hold on!
-Wait, what?</b>

15:44.190 --> 15:45.610
<b>Brace yourselves!</b>

15:45.690 --> 15:47.610
<b>Everyone prepare for impact!</b>

16:16.430 --> 16:17.550
<b>That really worked...</b>

16:19.010 --> 16:19.850
<b>Nice job.</b>

16:21.680 --> 16:24.440
<b>I can’t believe it.
You just saved our lives.</b>

16:26.610 --> 16:29.690
<b>Yeah. I didn’t think I’d be able to do it.</b>

16:30.360 --> 16:34.410
<b>That was pretty damn impressive.
Your ability’s stronger than you know.</b>

16:34.490 --> 16:35.450
<b>H-Hey!</b>

16:35.700 --> 16:38.410
<b>Unfasten your seatbelts.
We’re going to get you off of this plane.</b>

16:38.490 --> 16:39.950
<b>Leave all your luggage behind!</b>

16:40.040 --> 16:42.750
<b>-You’ve pushed yourself too far.
-Please remove high-heels!</b>

16:42.830 --> 16:44.080
<b>Let me give you a hand!</b>

16:45.250 --> 16:47.500
<b>Follow the person in front of you
and head to safety!</b>

16:47.580 --> 16:49.170
<b>Let’s go. We can’t be here.</b>

17:00.680 --> 17:02.890
<b>Jack. Where are we going?</b>

17:03.600 --> 17:06.900
<b>You’ve pushed your abilities
to their limits. Totally drained yourself.</b>

17:07.980 --> 17:09.360
<b>We’ll find a place to recover.</b>

17:11.570 --> 17:12.570
<b>A crash landing?</b>

17:13.400 --> 17:14.320
<b>Any survivors?</b>

17:14.400 --> 17:16.320
<b>We haven’t been able to establish contact.</b>

17:16.410 --> 17:18.280
<b>I need somebody
to get me an accurate report.</b>

17:26.540 --> 17:29.630
<b>The data's shifting.
We don't see any of the original signals.</b>

17:30.250 --> 17:32.960
<b>These are new signals,
and they’re coming in fast!</b>

17:34.170 --> 17:36.090
<b>You’re there now, Sarah.</b>

17:37.800 --> 17:39.930
<b>Am I really doing this?</b>

17:42.470 --> 17:45.020
<b>Did that test unlock my power?</b>

17:45.390 --> 17:46.230
<b><i>Is that...</i></b>

17:46.810 --> 17:47.640
<b>Makoto?</b>

17:59.410 --> 18:01.490
<b>You dragged me here... for a Portal?</b>

18:02.580 --> 18:06.750
<b>Portals heal. It’ll recharge your power.
Trust me, you’ll feel better soon.</b>

18:07.500 --> 18:08.790
<b>Try and get some shut eye.</b>

18:10.210 --> 18:11.040
<b>Right...</b>

18:12.540 --> 18:13.380
<b>Makoto!</b>

18:15.170 --> 18:16.010
<b>Makoto!</b>

18:17.170 --> 18:19.260
<b>Can’t you hear me? Hello?</b>

18:22.890 --> 18:25.310
<b>Jack, what is XM exactly?</b>

18:26.520 --> 18:28.690
<b>And why is it all over the planet?</b>

18:29.350 --> 18:31.060
<b>Wish I could say I had all the answers.</b>

18:31.440 --> 18:34.650
<b>I know it’s a subatomic,
information-bearing particle.</b>

18:35.110 --> 18:37.490
<b>And that it flows into our universe
from another dimension.</b>

18:38.400 --> 18:39.740
<b>Another dimension?</b>

18:40.570 --> 18:42.700
<b>It’s not from ours, that’s for sure.</b>

18:44.870 --> 18:49.040
<b>Imagine an underground water vein.
But with XM instead of water.</b>

18:49.830 --> 18:53.250
<b>And then in some places it just shoots up.
Like a spring.</b>

18:53.630 --> 18:55.050
<b>This isn’t answering my question.</b>

18:55.550 --> 18:58.840
<b>Look, it’s a metaphor, kid.
I’m doing the best I can.</b>

18:59.840 --> 19:04.600
<b>People felt these locations were special,
so they built monuments on them.</b>

19:05.470 --> 19:09.640
<b>Crowds gathered at those monuments,
the XM hotspots, and the rest is history.</b>

19:11.270 --> 19:14.150
<b>Some say all the Portals are connected.
Like one big underground lake.</b>

19:15.230 --> 19:19.530
<b>And at the bottom of which is an archive
of humanity’s collective memory.</b>

19:21.410 --> 19:24.530
<b>Christopher Brandt, my old boss,
was researching that.</b>

19:26.120 --> 19:30.540
<b>He was trying to unlock what he called
the infinite possibilities of the medium.</b>

19:33.000 --> 19:35.380
<b>And our abilities
have a connection to that?</b>

19:36.710 --> 19:42.800
<b>Yeah. I’m guessing your ability uses XM
to tap into that big archive of memories.</b>

19:44.850 --> 19:47.890
<b>Using that archive helps me peek
into the future, too.</b>

19:49.020 --> 19:49.850
<b>I see...</b>

19:50.350 --> 19:51.890
<b>What does that mean for Sarah’s powers?</b>

19:54.020 --> 19:54.860
<b>Makoto!</b>

19:55.810 --> 19:58.480
<b>Why can’t you hear? What can I do?</b>

19:59.150 --> 20:01.240
<b>All right. We need a new plan.</b>

20:01.900 --> 20:04.240
<b>We’ve gotta figure out how
to get into Switzerland.</b>

20:04.660 --> 20:06.490
<b>Right. And locate Sarah.</b>

20:07.490 --> 20:08.370
<b>You ready to go?</b>

20:08.620 --> 20:09.450
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:14.370 --> 20:15.830
<b>What the hell was that thing?</b>

20:15.920 --> 20:16.790
<b>A Glyph.</b>

20:16.880 --> 20:17.710
<b>A Glyph?</b>

20:18.300 --> 20:21.800
<b>Encoded signal inside the XM.
Each shape means something.</b>

20:22.420 --> 20:24.180
<b>We just need to know what this one is.</b>

20:25.220 --> 20:26.050
<b>"Help."</b>

20:27.220 --> 20:28.060
<b>Look!</b>

20:29.060 --> 20:29.890
<b>"I."</b>

20:30.890 --> 20:31.730
<b>"Past."</b>

20:32.310 --> 20:33.190
<b>"XM."</b>

20:33.940 --> 20:34.770
<b>"Discover."</b>

20:36.020 --> 20:37.860
<b>I wonder who’s sending this message.</b>

20:38.940 --> 20:40.730
<b>It’s Sarah. I know it.</b>

20:41.780 --> 20:43.360
<b>She’s just full of surprises.</b>

20:47.990 --> 20:51.580
<b>We’ve got a new signal.
This one’s completely distinct.</b>

20:55.500 --> 20:58.500
<b>She’s there! She has to be!
Hell of a clue...</b>

20:59.420 --> 21:00.840
<b>I think I’ve got this figured out.</b>

21:01.630 --> 21:05.840
<b>Six years ago, XM was discovered
in a top secret lab in Switzerland.</b>

21:06.470 --> 21:08.260
<b>Here’s where this all began.</b>

21:10.350 --> 21:14.140
<b>The Niantic Project, under CERN.
We’re headed into the eye of the storm.</b>

22:53.910 --> 22:55.910
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
